        <item>
            <title>0.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 03:47:19 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://tenonstudio.github.io/apps/bubble/</link>
            <sparkle:version>20261115</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Bubble 0.4.0</h2>
<p>This release rebuilds Bubble's extension runtime around self-contained JavaScript actions and adds dynamic actions, submenus and enforced permissions.</p>
<h3>JavaScript actions</h3>
<ul>
  <li>One public format: a <code>.js</code> action module with <code>definition</code> and <code>perform()</code>.</li>
  <li>Built-in actions are now JavaScript modules with metadata, options and availability defined in TypeScript.</li>
  <li>Actions are stored beside a metadata sidecar; legacy package formats and PopClip import are removed.</li>
  <li><code>require()</code>, multi-action modules and <code>defineExtension</code> are supported.</li>
  <li>Static and dynamic submenus, action populations and the <code>dynamic</code> entitlement are supported.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Runtime</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Async action execution, timers, Promise handling and permission errors.</li>
  <li>Expanded Buffer, Blob, XMLHttpRequest, RichString, URL and <code>$</code> shell support.</li>
  <li>AppleScript handlers and parameters, shell results, file scripts, ranged input data and regex captures.</li>
  <li>Capabilities are enforced by the bridge: clipboard, network, shell, automation, apps, files and storage.</li>
</ul>
<h3>UI</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Refreshed Actions settings, compact folder and action panels, and a smaller icon picker.</li>
  <li>Single-pane source viewer for one-file actions.</li>
  <li>Folder chevron spacing and stacked-bar spacing refinements.</li>
</ul>
<p>This build is signed with an Apple Development certificate and is not notarised. It is intended for local testing.</p>
]]></description>
